  {
   "type": "product_header",
   "title": "»smartCheck«",
   "text": "<p>Universal testing and measuring technology <br/>for process-oriented tool inspection</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/in/company/contact-us\">Request now</a></p>",
   "img": {
    "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/4/d/csm_smartcheck_header_789d77464a.webp",
    "alt": "",
    "w": 1080,
    "h": 930
   },
   "ftype": "zoller_product_header",
   "id": "c1606",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {
    "before": "default",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> We stand for smart progress </h2>",
   "body": "<p><strong>Are you searching for a powerful, universal testing and measuring machine for your cutting tools? ZOLLER offers its customers various solutions for checking tools in the most economical way before and after sharpening – unbeatable, indispensable, and 100% convincing.</strong></p> <p>With ZOLLER »smartCheck«, you can inspect and measure your tools and grinding wheels right next to the machine. You can achieve a high-precision quality check even when testing your tools before the resharpening process.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/in/company/contact-us\">Request now</a> <a href=\"https://myzoller.com/us/en/expert/booking/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">1:1 expert meeting</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/5/5/csm_smartcheck_start_01_14de603f3a.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1454,
     "h": 1454
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c1641",
   "bg": "black",
   "space": {
    "before": "default",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "",
   "body": "<p>Calibrating measuring devices on site with certified test specimens and reference standards is an important part of quality assurance at E. ZOLLER GmbH &amp; Co. KG - this is how we guarantee reliable measurement results and the high precision of your products in accordance with applicable standards.</p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/5/5/csm_zertifizierung_en_103ec5264d.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1699,
     "h": 539
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
